==To Start==
Speak with [[Tozer]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Information Center]].
==Goals==
Tozer has asked you to deliver a picture to the post office in Seaside.
*Take the picture to Enve LeStamp
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Tozer]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Information Center]].
#*"I am really enjoying the view here at Seaside. In fact I took a picture to send back home. Only I don't know where the post office is...<br />Would you be willing to take it for me?" -Tozer
#Speak with [[Enve LeStamp]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Seaside Post Office|Post Office]].
#*"Deliver this picture to Tozer's family in Merry Vale? Sure no problem!" -Enve LeStamp
